{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1254,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9885d1a8034f34e3e18f3f36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经习惯起床后没有女仆贴身服务了……\n哼哼，今天我也打扮得很漂亮吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5878061c365ac6c1e0c03576fee73e9343fc8e82fb9bdb1e0fa0708a6cf4189c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9734d90cc21f0e68df5863cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食堂的土豆炖肉很美味哦！\n因为祖国没什么人吃土豆，\n所以我一下子就迷上了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a951b6d0392bf9f32ed1eb7a1864b8d297ef9a5b54eb1962283c24dd59e7f285",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:537f5de915634488705cf33b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午后准备做一些比较轻松的运动哦～\n…对了！\n能陪我练下足球的传球吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "81c134453ac602a11682c5b0b5236f5aa95d5d222843aeeedf37a9d8e17a9bbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:592f8f0927479cec45371588",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也辛苦你啦～♪\n你今天也过得很开心吧？\n希望明天也是美好的一天呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fa8984e2af6fd5ef79606ad0caac9774b9255bf15b7963db4939f26cf1adfe6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:567ca82f74e051fbd9398d9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在考虑睡觉前要不要喝脱咖啡因红茶呢…\n你要一起来喝吗？\n还能一起玩红茶占卜呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c277a3c5038d6642443fa98178a5573d67d12a430163f9e563b9beaa24e06cf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58ac23a2ed0a596b1b530cb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前在公园里，\n看见了好多白色三叶草呢。\n好像能用花冠来进行加冕典礼的样子♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "86d49cb6a25e0adc5facbfb10b76b0afeb932f69324469019cb605a5840c70ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2052dafacdca1868b365f695",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～每天都很热呢～。\n虽然也去不少国家视察过了…\n但这个湿度果然只有日本了呢！有这种感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58220747042d604c85758342075a273fce27dd857d591dc23626f524ab98c774",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2e9022af65be37f6c03db6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日本的三叶草，\n是不是在秋天就会减少呀…？呒呒…！\n因为变得珍贵了，说不定找到之后就更幸福了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad93b2a370c617ab87b3e7a4d7080a9eada9722b4f54ebca43122b37d4b71fa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3eae3def305de06321e47e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在很冷的时候，\n就会很喜欢喝女仆小姐做得超甜的奶茶呢…\n我会用马克杯喝很多呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d24fd6f559cca8eaa9a492d6ed982cfa7eecfc29d9e7c3e8eb0d044561bec3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78b11c54e3b5ec306153b08a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在是美妙的晨间问答时间♪\r\n问：我的左边鞋子里，\r\n正放着什么东西呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4730bfb490db88888d953e3cdbc57e21aefb908e8d9a1424ae3542280a2ceb3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7270c8b7c37b11a176111cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今天做了个特别有趣的梦哦！\r\n我梦见在婚礼上，学园的大家都来为我进行暖戒礼呢！\r\n（暖戒礼：西式婚礼上将婚戒传给所有人以表祝福）",
      "source_fingerprint": "358f181cb09efcf08ff7a7d5b23b8cbbd06217ead56104c18a5098d9e2298c39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f37d0647a6de77e7ce256dd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天已经过去一半了呢！\r\n真是时光飞逝呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02124a77ec29643eb25453544fe441186d9e29a3febbb37d957171b84781971a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09488dc5ca19c1a9a57e2c51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来考虑下婚礼上怎么招待来宾吧！\r\n就用三明治作为手拿小吃怎么样？♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7aa03bdb7048c9608ef1fe85486498aedf65a8801b7a33c47d641e210bd94b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05ee382f0ef80a106cd039e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爱尔兰的婚礼会持续很长一段时间哦！\r\n大家一起彻夜饮酒跳舞……\r\n真的很有意思哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "466d263858ee9acfdc8167515bef14ff1a9cc8289d5f8d084beeef9bd1b093ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b6ad200da87b69066bb7647",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多到First dance的时间了吧？\r\n一起分享这段无上美妙的时间吧～\r\n能请你牵上我的手吗，Darling？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f0abb45aa0f701e7aa06a24b707d68ae3a8afb1c4ee9ed784e75d784dc517b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1794f8065f81b72fdf93337",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我刚刚去赏了花，真的好美呢！\r\n樱花在身边飞舞，\r\n简直就像沐浴在婚礼的花雨中一样呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88ddb3a3e2bc2c317b247e35106b120c04f6b8df9cc08f31248be2ef3b4dbbe0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f050324d197063a2a408ca7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前段时间去小摊上玩了会『抠糖饼』，\r\n不过没想到店主对成品的审查那么严格，\r\n真是吓了我一跳呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d5dd59d42382ad94203686d1091edf3061fa7a8b36e18b423cf26c3a646d72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b092f2eae92bde7efc15f7fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在看蜻蜓的时候，\r\n神宫教了我些很有意思的事情哦。\r\n……让我看看你的手指吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "77ffb7afb6fe734720bf4c45d39639f44b27210f3b071a8d807222b03780b5b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72e04f32a0136ccb793c9a5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等冬天回爱尔兰的时候，\r\n干脆带些暖宝宝做伴手礼吧。\r\n女仆小姐们肯定会很开心的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0b940996dc335403433cc48e0cf16d93f706cc0f2acbfd12dc1792383bfac2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fdaeaf926b1ae7508e17459",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c30a839f4b3a04cb69b06733e358064fb84cd7e12982a53b1f6375b733a7d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fcf0f841043bd89338ba593",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c30a839f4b3a04cb69b06733e358064fb84cd7e12982a53b1f6375b733a7d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79beec0caf3fadd135df3991",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前呀，气槽同学跟我说\n『天天吃拉面，你真吃不厌啊』…\n因为有各种各样的味道，所以吃不厌哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a559beacbeb2f64b9381eb1e0148544796cbfc8e49a944fdaf8751fa77ae1f97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d993243aa028c447ca7eb0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有次我想邀请神宫参加茶会，\n就说『咖啡因能提高工作效率』\n…结果她真的来了呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e98d1654fbac3c428b1902c47baf361e1c1bf3485d978177974bcb9e4bee4cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a702d7ae7eae6586e03678b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小花的便当看起来就像是小小的宝石箱呢。\n也想让我家的主厨也看看呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4fdc9a779e23006fb7942021514eefc1193e7a99e2b3b7eb2f2ce5b26136599",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3136cef70071123fd49dbdfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小川上给我推荐了『公主战士』！\n是部很有趣的电影呢～♪\n要是我的国家也上映就好啦…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ced3c672bf6e5ac14050870ef2f3d5ea55fc19461579a8a14a84f9476903852d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0642b5f0be238ea59933211",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然父亲已经允许了我的任性，\n那我也得拿出令他骄傲的成绩。\n这样才能昂首挺胸地回国嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddcab2cf296323e8245559e6da4e6237f528d214b49a366e061c987c86e59cd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afd6eacbd92e091b2e0a6bf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又方便行动又不失华丽地衣服…！\n是谁设计的呢？\n还挺想向那人订制一件晚礼服的…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b81d4e9326157dddea98a5b76b18552648ae78add6873836c0cb6e6c1e4aec5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0388c6a02d3f07554f45e6da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家穿着一样的衣服的话，\n就有种麻利的感觉！\n这金色的纽扣也很棒哦～很像我家的仪仗兵呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "21209c5b749f193c2cce6453bfff5020ea97c5551f9463466bb6ce4263a7442b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66dc7d24e790943d17b41a3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件决胜服，\n是以我最喜欢的三叶草为主题设计的哦\n上面也有很多三叶草的装饰♪哼哼，要猜猜都在哪儿吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ba1afac5b08906f1261bb54d7a4eada9883a19024d310e129118ed1fbf4b30f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dabdf5a53a30ce880f1c2417",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵…制服也好，这件衣服也好，\n都是露出膝盖的设计，感觉很轻松呢！\n真是新鲜的感觉～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3ce7c7241dda2e6c91c3d3fd68db722771f6bee0161290b4b1d23ada614eb5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5869d855e8f4b0898cb48610",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天早上晨练的时候，\n看见伴着朝露的三叶草在闪闪发光啦～\n让我想起以前城堡里花园的事情了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d29926099d52fd4a8b48c486290cfea9bb0a8630f5470835db146ab5f28e97bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5a4ec75ca518f52fd04ed1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午的训练也要努力了哦。\n能不能留下美好的回忆，\n取决于我的实力如何嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4db828a3b0546f137d8be06e547fb1d1d03e452524277c3d69330fbe5068f0f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d65bffb4258636c5f07f21eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也得早点睡了呢。\n要是我熬夜太晚的话，\n护卫的各位轮流值班可是很辛苦的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9b2441822624959b96840136241d112a9e055218bb49b2b768773fe35fb0e69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:150ffb6ddba3024ac61ba9f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦啦啦～♪这个国家的春天很漂亮，\n让人心情很好呢～♪\n一整天都能看见碧蓝的天空，像做梦一样呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77238e65c17bbd649296abcacf19f0265d747d443c0c62133991973d0aee6576",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57932fd3ddee2dc24229a135",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为日本的夏夜一整晚都很暗，\n所以能看见很漂亮的星星呢。\n是不是也能做个好梦呢…♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "440f4d9aab7ead4029caba4a934d5d8bc44d7193bc56e12c0de73134c3083780",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe95e1983186ad5be8bdf22e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在日本喜欢吃的东西…是松茸吧！\n闻起来很香，吃着也很美味呢～♪\n食堂会不会做呢…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc9733b8c0bb6c9acddd978b18da3bec3637549207af18f968ae32fcdcbc531f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e8d067ed7f92024345510a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被炉可真厉害呀～♪\n居然能把桌子和床合二为一…\n是足以授勋的好主意呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d849ec8ad33f6de35c7c7f7dd8b75eb3208d85dec1d0ea2efc9991a1fd165d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a75211b5fd9a5ff0ee1f0c01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "单身夜派对虽然很特别，但也容易让人觉得寂寞呢。\r\n要是我举办这个派对的话，大家会来吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5690ede6f66e524c29a8e29e962d1324bf45dcc19e598deff85c7290be36334c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:405873abf17eac1c6a1ba7f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我告诉我的姐姐，\r\n气槽同学也有一身非常漂亮的决胜服……\r\n哼哼，事态一下子就超出控制了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d1a308fbca576f079fab734dabe5305167bd262da59f555a1d6ca2785c2cb2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e23c1e1f00e5c86d54fb986",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正在和多伯筹备下一次暗锅派对哦。\r\n训练员也要来吗？\r\n（暗锅派对：每个人随便带食材，把带来的食材全部著进锅里）",
      "source_fingerprint": "17e377668b60bf4d0906faf92abafeb7f4e42e66a5d9ce6c7623eb331fe6fe2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71dd1387bb3485018ef5608f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前段时间，\r\n我悄悄去了光明爸爸开的那家游乐园哦。\r\n没想到平日里游乐园会有这么多人呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82deb10f5750cc4a7657031769e235a473961406bfeb38d629aa325978902f68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04a4b83664482fcc00bd39d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这身决胜服的话，就不能吃拉面了呢……\r\n等等，要是用叉子的话说不定就可以了？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e16c7d6446c0e5cd79a0135adad44b45dded2fbe7fec998b593149e95d145da4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91559b3be6bb87304879f5d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最喜欢的就是味增汤了哦！\r\n不过偶尔也还是会怀念焦焦的依斯皮尼\r\n和脆脆的鸡蛋烧呢。（依斯皮尼：isipini，爱尔兰食物）",
      "source_fingerprint": "150f5318db6bb09d510de48908bb7abf58b65a84e5817832e51f950f8f580b71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e767a627b5c1e356bd74b680",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的午饭就吃之前准备的“那个”吧！\r\n那个只需要三分钟，就能变成拉面的魔法食物♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f6f00c8403decee6e0da8d73136cf2e8fe0e1fb24f29574fb62cfb40f6e0902",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aac22e60af5f6a1697f27125",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，度过了美好的一天呢！\r\n虽然忙忙碌碌的，但闹得也很开心！\r\n今晚一定能很快就入眠吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b73f58d1a392def40ed4ab232531739a7b8f43e9a161b2ce2a52bfb817c2b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1ecb2c780c416fca5629f4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前种的三叶草田也热闹起来了呢！\r\n以前还经常和姐姐一起玩加冕过家家呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c4f6fe1b91b7e94516649e9a2a218b63c82196e52aced9553c5ec33108d56c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8861641fc85528522f66e331",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日本的夏天开始了的话，\r\n“那个”就要开始售卖了呢。就是那个……嗯，\r\n中华冷面！",
      "source_fingerprint": "965f885e115e53ab8d2e671930ae0ab44ec58600fb8c0e83fdbe460ebc015ca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:612f44bb481759a4fd46e95a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我祖国的秋天有时会突然降温呢。\r\n但就算如此，\r\n我也只找队长借过一次围巾哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1785aa5c48bde055f567e7a2f5880a6aa727540301bfe0d77b549c2b955fca0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:647270f8750019d38803ef44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，前段时间下雪的时候，\r\n我在训练员室的窗边堆了个小小的雪人哦？\r\n你有注意到吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "966d6e16672279817f921c73e3c20fab2e1f77f57d759902347a875f5f34f137",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:851d84b32d6058bd72ab29e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你让我尽情地绽放光芒了呢。\r\n你做得非常棒哦……\r\n只要感到你的心意，我就会情不自禁地挺直腰背呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "213e44efeeaae9d57ad0cb447a309bd37f7c43bf946352dc4fed648f0a5bfdb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f59848fafc7959385483ea4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实，凯尔特结也有『永恒』的意思哦。\r\n真是敌不过Beauty小姐呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4029fd5cf46afe6cce1bd5b6ff1f2a9ec6e2ff2166d2621140c4a4c2830e0bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56edcca646cd47e2533f9ac5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要进行怎样的训练呢？\n我得拿出让祖国骄傲的实力来才行呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "91adbb2f844b73231cdbaf5596cd04d131551d988ecd8dd6dbb1e0a239c0e6d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff95160f1bfdd7384c5af574",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張るよー♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6727933993499d6c5c3b246be3b1447ad23cba3d295b81e288451484400d204",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3df585947e06085187e3708",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我也遇见不少家庭教师了…\n但果然你的教育方式是最好的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e29bb445c9ca8a821cd49ad8b1c85aebcf455aef4bb6bb76f0a33181db990838",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0b4074dc8208164fc3c64f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力奔跑时留下的回忆，\n一定会坚强而骄傲地留在我心中吧♪\n在将来，也会成为我成长的食粮…",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e5ab7dd58442268a322e6e65a4e5a39b8c1e11b51f4d5552be5df1da2a1d75d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcc6791beff0cb308dc780e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我刚刚看见了四叶草哦！\n感觉今天的训练会很顺利呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f297a6e48658a211cbe668c997b00dc51c384d30542d62499553de515eecc78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1300a7e49f63fd75a3dd27d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我，必须变得更强才行…\n以后还能和怎样让人激动的事物相遇，\n还烦请您好好教导我哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "10fbe6226fb26fee1e3ca78ca1f1d2aca95db75fd634f62b67e2376e1affc373",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c19486597089fc802a0500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然父亲允许了我参加比赛…\n那么我也不能辜负他的期待。\n让我们共勉吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fefcb639c9100f80d7393d715c43455109f055be425e7f4316927fd03077c431",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce11e2400e0c40b61e3dff38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了留下回忆，所以做了什么事情很重要……\n不过，和谁一起做更加重要。\n是你来做训练员，真是太好啦…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d5e9c7ef0fc4ee95258f6ade52698d6b29d7a4bbcbb9520be1a778ff7dc22a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f339bdce9eeb8196c39a6e2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打西瓜好像很有趣呢！\n训练结束后一起玩怎么样？\n也能给护卫的各位来点凉爽的食物♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "906e1a640f34178fa6df17188e832a8cb3f59efa2152d924dead41fe48344bae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebaf8e895893cdf558c9e019",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请阁下从今往后也继续指引我前行。\r\n——这是我所下达的至高命令哦。\r\n……哼哼，怎么样？吓到了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef3e43f2fd2fd6d39b4ce51a3034dfbe873537a6fc1037bce8f32ff439a6aee2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc7d6bc52844efd34096f1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们二人一起打开新世界的大门吧！\r\n……感觉会很有趣呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c82832cf401dbb2340d659a8034d803108832cea651ceb47a3b86feeacc0acb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fc0f28e62734a8196f4500c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件决胜服【婚纱】也不是每天都能穿上的，\r\n所以今天也要加油哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8183451071fef6d62a99d46b4b6f250ecc18f4d96b1a9f864e576942c0f473e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c99b2eee3264ecc526ae6635",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢你做的训练笔记哦。\r\n你一定在上面描绘了不少与我共度的时光对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c765d9433063a85ad0ada6aa783067ba4d5ac6c675726e8e97af848299def30e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:673a625df71772404f6a3239",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件决胜服【婚纱】上寄宿着我的光辉与理想，\r\n所以一定要拿出语气相衬的仪态才行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b3ca8b49ee16034d96ea436191903bc6a6f7a4d9bf3590f701b8d7f5896e455",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:760c5413d953deb2fe749d36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然这条道路终将迎来尽头——\r\n就让我们携手并肩，一起前进吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cae9cfa213468bec3bccf19f7a925ef5c2fc7912bf7858ced8149d9fcfff2df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1be7b3702eddea7231f2fb42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员。\r\n能请你往后也继续注视着我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ebab3fdad8ba86a1e622be0581f7319c709cafe62b46dbf98b378d3c29e22f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9deb77229a1352a25d6d1925",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢，实在是麻烦你了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfb0e5eb437cd44a4f464fa4eac2ca7aa77b554a794f8bea4b1964feb3cf5fb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d609e25f71bd406b5268668",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "留下了难以忘怀的美妙回忆呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d9388b8d2688433dede40cc54878abe0d0ce79c544ea6529468e62c084b6efc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:118d81ff317f8cf94dd203df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与你共同创造的回忆，我永世难忘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95c781bc2066bad402f2cf9d0ed1263d1451e4af11bdbc79812ec5c99e3e4c72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eba9974b9bb6adf5fe9ef87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来绑个丝带好啦。能请你助我一臂之力吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6274b65f24482ae3c510afadbd83725587b729934c5f6c6982916115e6afc29a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c713177d6fa687701d43042",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断学习，不断成长，达成使命的那天终会到来…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c16094dd1a0902e306307ef968ea11f25d457e949c6be16c0fa35be91b141d56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63c7d92b16127b0b9e6f8fa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊！\n感觉能留下最棒的回忆呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "18de76fbc32f2a9c58cfa1dcc7c74b59daa55ce21a5c8d945f2a479ccecec68c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a2ef300614daa0d5ce23db2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贵安♪我是美妙姿势哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7122359e6a604675aa053d7fb7564ec63da499c69b2a8abe865413fffa2c4c2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d0ff6bdb30bcdb15a725fe3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "包含着美妙回忆的三叶草！\n能和我一起，去把它找出来吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "133ac421d25372feedb825b3f5b92693d51ed5ddbaddddd459d64f513e111bb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f39a0ad9087b893811f0c861",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要我辅助吗？都听你的～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "35f6e7b0f7ab561b0647801e338c6401bf2e614b5014d614776dc123f5f705c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d31b12368fe7a18dae1797d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再多依赖我一些也好的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e8ebe3f2700d6c09f202e51c1d59054e995ceefe8aec200387ca94b8071241c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48da33d1452f6c0dba95411d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从今往后的这段时间里，\r\n也请你继续陪伴着我哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fdfce208eab47ffe39a34ecb8880c834b06264f2506e6d6b5d201990faae73b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46138e5d07f6f9af0ee33ac7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得到了受恩惠的祝福呢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb1bcbb7f04c324e34d16b81b59d8abd5a73827e0f0babb346a3dcbb4cc2e915",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49d26fc2b3bd5ba9c4ac747b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能请你发誓吗——\r\n从今往后，也要与我一同向前奔跑！",
